  "description": "Ban Yeon-Ha, troubled by debts, makes a proposal to her boss and long-time hidden crush. \n\n\"You need a woman who will take your money, give you a child, and won't complain or expect too much. How about me?\" \n\nSeo Gang-Hyeon, a man who does not believe in a woman's sweet words, sneers at his young secretary. \n\n\"Are you sure you can accept my conditions?\"\n\"Yes, but the money… I want it when I deliver the child.\"\n\"All of it?\"\n\"Yes… to pay off my debts.\" \n\nShe was hoping to finally cast off the shackles that have bound her all her life. But Seo Gang-Hyeon has other ideas. \n\n\"Am I some sort of cuck? Give money to the mother of my child only for her to fly away?\" \n\nThe old Seo Gang-Hyeon might not have cared, but there's no way Gang-Hyeon will let her go now. \n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
